Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}大魔王的遗产
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}诺顿克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}亚多拉玛雷克的魔枪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}仪轨的魔导
